    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Setup (about 10 minutes)\n1. Make a Google Sheet with a tab named **Orders** and paste the header row from `sheet-headers.csv` (first row).\n2. Open **Settings** and fill in your sheet URL, email and names.\n3. Connect your accounts on every node with a warning (Google Sheets, Slack).\n4. In Shopify (Settings > Notifications > Webhooks, event Order creation) or WooCommerce (Settings > Advanced > Webhooks) add this **Webhook** URL.\n5. Click **Execute workflow**, send a test, then switch the workflow to **Active**.",
        "height": 300,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 7
